<%# ENTRA MIGRATION (phase 2, demo): new page, the access token as the Patron API received it. %>
<h1>Access token sent to the Patron API</h1>
<p class="lede">The portal attached this token to its request; the Patron API validated it and sent back what it
   received. It is the token the API exchanges for a Microsoft Graph token in the On-Behalf-Of check.</p>

<div class="card">
  <% if @error %>
    <p><%= @error %></p>
  <% else %>
    <dl>
      <dt><code>aud</code></dt><dd>Who the token is for: the Patron API, not the portal (compare the ID token on Home)</dd>
      <dt><code>scp</code></dt><dd>Delegated scopes the user's sign-in granted the portal on this API</dd>
      <dt><code>roles</code></dt><dd>The user's app roles on the Patron API</dd>
      <dt><code>azp</code></dt><dd>The app holding the token: the portal's client ID</dd>
      <dt><code>oid</code></dt><dd>The user's object ID, which On-Behalf-Of keeps through the exchange</dd>
    </dl>
    <h3>Header</h3>
    <pre class="token"><%= JSON.pretty_generate(@token["header"]) %></pre>
    <h3>Claims</h3>
    <pre class="token"><%= JSON.pretty_generate(@token["claims"]) %></pre>
  <% end %>
</div>
<p><%= link_to "Next: check On-Behalf-Of with Microsoft Graph", graph_check_path, class: "btn" %>
   <%= link_to "Back to home", root_path %></p>
